# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from using the server-side Sampler and Estimator to the client-side implementations of these primitives in IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Migrasi daripada penggunaan Sampler dan Estimator sisi pelayan kepada pelaksanaan sisi klien primitif ini dalam IBM Quantum Compute Service"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator"
msgstr "Migrasi daripada Sampler dan Estimator sisi pelayan ke sisi klien"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate from server-side to client-side Sampler and Estimator {#migrate-from-server-side-to-client-side-sampler-and-estimator}"
msgstr "Migrasi daripada Sampler dan Estimator sisi pelayan ke sisi klien {#migrate-from-server-side-to-client-side-sampler-and-estimator}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to migrate from the **server-side** implementations of IBM Quantum&reg;\n"
"`Sampler` and `Estimator` to their new **client-side** implementations in\n"
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime`. The interfaces and options are largely unchanged, so most code\n"
"runs as-is, but there are some behavioral differences to understand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menerangkan cara memigrasi daripada pelaksanaan **sisi pelayan** IBM Quantum&reg;\n"
"`Sampler` dan `Estimator` kepada pelaksanaan **sisi klien** baharu mereka dalam\n"
"`qiskit-ibm-runtime`. Antara muka dan pilihan sebahagian besarnya tidak berubah, jadi kebanyakan kod\n"
"berjalan seadanya, tetapi terdapat beberapa perbezaan tingkah laku yang perlu difahami.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Latar Belakang {#background}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sampler and Estimator are primitive *interfaces* defined in Qiskit. The IBM Quantum\n"
"Compute Service (formerly Qiskit Runtime) has historically provided the *implementation*\n"
"of these primitives inside its runtime environment. When you call `sampler.run()` or\n"
"`estimator.run()`, the request is sent to the service, and **all** computation — including\n"
"error suppression and mitigation — happens on the server side.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sampler dan Estimator ialah *antara muka* primitif yang ditakrifkan dalam Qiskit. IBM Quantum\n"
"Compute Service (dahulunya Qiskit Runtime) secara sejarahnya telah menyediakan *pelaksanaan*\n"
"primitif ini di dalam persekitaran runtime-nya. Apabila anda memanggil `sampler.run()` atau\n"
"`estimator.run()`, permintaan dihantar ke perkhidmatan tersebut, dan **semua** pengiraan — termasuk\n"
"penindasan dan pengurangan ralat — berlaku pada sisi pelayan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This black-box experience is convenient: you don't have to worry about implementation\n"
"details. But it also makes the primitives hard to debug, customize, or learn from,\n"
"because you can't see what happens during processing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengalaman kotak hitam ini adalah mudah: anda tidak perlu risau tentang butiran\n"
"pelaksanaan. Tetapi ia juga menjadikan primitif ini sukar untuk dinyahpepijat, disesuaikan, atau dipelajari,\n"
"kerana anda tidak dapat melihat apa yang berlaku semasa pemprosesan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newly introduced [directed execution model](/guides/directed-execution-model#directed-execution-model-beta) takes the opposite approach and\n"
"provides a **white-box** experience. All design intents are captured on the client side,\n"
"and a single server-side primitive [**Executor**](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) processes those inputs exactly as\n"
"directed — it makes no implicit decisions on your behalf.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Model pelaksanaan terarah](/guides/directed-execution-model#directed-execution-model-beta) yang baru diperkenalkan mengambil pendekatan bertentangan dan\n"
"menyediakan pengalaman **kotak putih**. Semua niat reka bentuk ditangkap pada sisi klien,\n"
"dan satu primitif sisi pelayan [**Executor**](/guides/directed-execution-model#executor-primitive) memproses input tersebut dengan tepat seperti\n"
"yang diarahkan — ia tidak membuat sebarang keputusan tersirat bagi pihak anda.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Starting in `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, Sampler and Estimator are re-implemented\n"
"on the **client side** on top of Executor. They provide the same convenience and\n"
"abstraction as before, and now you can inspect the implementation details when you need\n"
"to. Because the interfaces and options remain largely the same, migration should be\n"
"seamless.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bermula dalam `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, Sampler dan Estimator dilaksanakan semula\n"
"pada **sisi klien** di atas Executor. Mereka menyediakan kemudahan dan\n"
"abstraksi yang sama seperti sebelum ini, dan kini anda boleh memeriksa butiran pelaksanaan apabila anda perlu\n"
"berbuat demikian. Kerana antara muka dan pilihan kekal sebahagian besarnya sama, migrasi sepatutnya\n"
"lancar.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Note: IBM Quantum only supports version 2 of Sampler and Estimator interfaces (`BaseSamplerV2` and `BaseEstimatorV2`). Therefore, they are simply referred to as Sampler and Estimator in this guide.\n"
msgstr "Nota: IBM Quantum hanya menyokong versi 2 antara muka Sampler dan Estimator (`BaseSamplerV2` dan `BaseEstimatorV2`). Oleh itu, ia hanya dirujuk sebagai Sampler dan Estimator dalam panduan ini.\n"

