# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job splitting {#job-splitting}"
msgstr "Pemisahan kerja {#job-splitting}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When you have to split one job into several because mixed shot or precision\n"
"values in a single job are no longer supported, consider the following:\n"
msgstr ""
"Apabila anda perlu memisahkan satu kerja kepada beberapa kerja kerana nilai shot atau ketepatan\n"
"yang bercampur dalam satu kerja tidak lagi disokong, pertimbangkan perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Group the PUBs by their target value — one job per distinct value, not one job per\n"
"PUB.** Splitting is a regrouping, so the total number of PUBs you submit does not change.\n"
"For example, given `[A@0.01, B@0.05, C@0.01]`, submit two jobs: `[A, C]` at `precision=0.01` and `[B]`\n"
"at `precision=0.05`. Submitting `A` and `C` as separate jobs is less efficient, as each job comes with a fixed overhead.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Kumpulkan PUB mengikut nilai sasaran mereka — satu kerja bagi setiap nilai berbeza, bukan satu kerja bagi setiap\n"
"PUB.** Pemisahan adalah pengumpulan semula, jadi jumlah bilangan PUB yang anda hantar tidak berubah.\n"
"Sebagai contoh, diberi `[A@0.01, B@0.05, C@0.01]`, hantar dua kerja: `[A, C]` pada `precision=0.01` dan `[B]`\n"
"pada `precision=0.05`. Menghantar `A` dan `C` sebagai kerja berasingan adalah kurang cekap, kerana setiap kerja datang dengan overhead tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Learn once and use the noise models in all split jobs.** It is more efficient to\n"
"run a single `NoiseLearnerV3` job over the union of all layers.\n"
"The result of a noise learner job contains a list of `NoiseLearnerV3Result` objects,\n"
"one for each input instruction, and is in the same order as the input list. You can\n"
"use the output of this noise learner job in all the split (Estimator) jobs, and noise\n"
"models for layers not in the PUBs of a split job are ignored.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pelajari sekali dan gunakan model hingar dalam semua kerja yang dipisahkan.** Adalah lebih cekap untuk\n"
"menjalankan satu kerja `NoiseLearnerV3` ke atas gabungan semua lapisan.\n"
"Hasil kerja pembelajar hingar mengandungi senarai objek `NoiseLearnerV3Result`,\n"
"satu untuk setiap arahan input, dan mengikut susunan yang sama seperti senarai input. Anda boleh\n"
"menggunakan output kerja pembelajar hingar ini dalam semua kerja (Estimator) yang dipisahkan, dan model\n"
"hingar untuk lapisan yang tiada dalam PUB kerja yang dipisahkan akan diabaikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Submit all the split jobs in a `Batch` first, then collect their results.**\n"
"The `Batch` execution mode provides efficient parallel execution when there are multiple jobs.\n"
"However, `job.result()` is blocking, so calling it inside the submission loop serializes the jobs and negates the benefits of using `Batch`.\n"
"Make sure you use the submit-all-then-collect pattern (shown below).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hantar semua kerja yang dipisahkan dalam `Batch` terlebih dahulu, kemudian kumpulkan hasilnya.**\n"
"Mod pelaksanaan `Batch` menyediakan pelaksanaan selari yang cekap apabila terdapat pelbagai kerja.\n"
"Walau bagaimanapun, `job.result()` adalah menyekat, jadi memanggilnya di dalam gelung penghantaran akan menyiri-alirkan kerja tersebut dan menghapuskan faedah menggunakan `Batch`.\n"
"Pastikan anda menggunakan corak hantar-semua-kemudian-kumpul (ditunjukkan di bawah).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In the following example, `pub1` and `pub2` require `precision=0.5`, whereas `pub3` requires `precision=0.1`:\n"
msgstr "Dalam contoh berikut, `pub1` dan `pub2` memerlukan `precision=0.5`, manakala `pub3` memerlukan `precision=0.1`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Job inputs structure {#job-inputs-structure}"
msgstr "Struktur input kerja {#job-inputs-structure}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The new implementation maps Sampler or Estimator inputs to Executor inputs, so `job.inputs` returns a dictionary that contains Executor inputs. This dictionary has the following keys:\n"
msgstr "Pelaksanaan baharu memetakan input Sampler atau Estimator kepada input Executor, jadi `job.inputs` mengembalikan kamus yang mengandungi input Executor. Kamus ini mempunyai kekunci berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`options`: The input [`ExecutorOption`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options).\n"
msgstr "`options`: Input [`ExecutorOption`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options-models-executor-options).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`quantum_program`: The input [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program)\n"
msgstr "`quantum_program`: Input [`QuantumProgram`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/quantum-program-quantum-program)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`schema_version`: The server-side schema version used.\n"
msgstr "`schema_version`: Versi skema sisi pelayan yang digunakan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your code used `job.inputs['options']` to find options specified for the job, you can now use `job.result().metadata['options']` instead.\n"
msgstr "Jika kod anda menggunakan `job.inputs['options']` untuk mencari pilihan yang dinyatakan untuk kerja tersebut, kini anda boleh menggunakan `job.result().metadata['options']` sebaliknya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test locally with a fake backend {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"
msgstr "Uji secara tempatan dengan backend palsu {#test-locally-with-a-fake-backend}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before submitting to hardware, you can validate the migrated code against a `Fake*`\n"
"backend to catch any syntax errors early. Note the following details about local testing mode:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebelum menghantar ke perkakasan, anda boleh mengesahkan kod yang dimigrasi terhadap backend `Fake*`\n"
"untuk mengesan sebarang ralat sintaks lebih awal. Ambil perhatian butiran berikut tentang mod ujian tempatan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**It does not reproduce hardware results.** Local noisy simulation does not perfectly\n"
"replicate real device noise, and therefore the outputs might differ. Running does validate\n"
"that the option paths and value types are correct.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Ia tidak menghasilkan semula hasil perkakasan.** Simulasi hingar tempatan tidak\n"
"mereplikasi hingar peranti sebenar dengan sempurna, oleh itu output mungkin berbeza. Menjalankannya tetap mengesahkan\n"
"bahawa laluan pilihan dan jenis nilai adalah betul.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- `NoiseLearnerV3` has **no local testing mode**: its `mode` accepts only a real `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, or `Batch`, so you cannot exercise the noise-learning step against a fake\n"
"backend. Verify that part of your code against the\n"
"[`NoiseLearnerV3` API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3) instead. Confirm that the constructor,\n"
"the `run(instructions)` input shape, and any helper (such as the unique-layer helper) are\n"
"used as documented.\n"
msgstr ""
"- `NoiseLearnerV3` **tiada mod ujian tempatan**: `mode`-nya hanya menerima `Backend`,\n"
"`Session`, atau `Batch` sebenar, jadi anda tidak boleh menjalankan langkah pembelajaran hingar terhadap backend\n"
"palsu. Sahkan bahagian kod anda itu terhadap\n"
"[rujukan API `NoiseLearnerV3`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/noise-learner-v3-noise-learner-v3) sebaliknya. Sahkan bahawa konstruktor,\n"
"bentuk input `run(instructions)`, dan sebarang pembantu (seperti pembantu lapisan unik) digunakan\n"
"seperti yang didokumenkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cliffordize the circuit for efficient local simulation {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"
msgstr "Cliffordkan litar untuk simulasi tempatan yang cekap {#cliffordize-the-circuit-for-efficient-local-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A fake backend uses a statevector (noisy) simulator, whose cost grows exponentially with\n"
"qubit count and depth. Thus, a realistic workload circuit can hang or exhaust memory. Since\n"
"local testing only needs to exercise the option paths (not reproduce physical results),\n"
"reduce the circuit to a Clifford one first with\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"which rounds each `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` angle to the nearest multiple of π/2. Clifford circuits\n"
"simulate efficiently (stabilizer simulation) regardless of size.\n"
msgstr ""
"Backend palsu menggunakan penstimulasi statevector (hingar), yang kosnya berkembang secara eksponen dengan\n"
"bilangan qubit dan kedalaman. Oleh itu, litar beban kerja yang realistik boleh tergantung atau menghabiskan memori. Kerana\n"
"ujian tempatan hanya perlu menjalankan laluan pilihan (bukan menghasilkan semula keputusan fizikal),\n"
"kurangkan litar kepada litar Clifford terlebih dahulu dengan\n"
"[`ConvertISAToClifford`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/transpiler-passes-convert-isa-to-clifford),\n"
"yang membundarkan setiap sudut `RZ`/`RZZ`/`RX` kepada gandaan π/2 yang terdekat. Litar Clifford\n"
"disimulasikan dengan cekap (simulasi penstabil) tanpa mengira saiz.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ConvertISAToClifford` **requires an ISA circuit** as input (the output of\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` targeting the backend). You must account for the following consequences\n"
"when constructing the local PUB:\n"
msgstr ""
"`ConvertISAToClifford` **memerlukan litar ISA** sebagai input (output daripada\n"
"`generate_preset_pass_manager(...).run(...)` yang menyasarkan backend). Anda perlu mengambil kira akibat berikut\n"
"apabila membina PUB tempatan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**The `.layout` attribute is dropped.** The Cliffordized circuit keeps the same qubit\n"
"count, but `clifford.layout` is `None`, so `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`\n"
"fails. Lay the observable out from the **pre-Clifford ISA** circuit instead:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, then run `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Atribut `.layout` digugurkan.** Litar yang telah di-Cliffordkan mengekalkan bilangan qubit\n"
"yang sama, tetapi `clifford.layout` adalah `None`, jadi `observable.apply_layout(clifford.layout)`\n"
"gagal. Susun observable tersebut daripada litar **ISA pra-Clifford** sebaliknya:\n"
"`isa_obs = observable.apply_layout(isa_circuit.layout)`, kemudian jalankan `(clifford, isa_obs)`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-28
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Parameters are bound away.** Rounding the rotation angles turns a parametric ISA circuit\n"
"into a concrete Clifford one, so `clifford.num_parameters` becomes `0`. A PUB that still\n"
"carries a parameter-values array fails coercion. For the local run, drop the parameter\n"
"array from the PUB; the hardware run keeps the original parametric circuit and its values.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Parameter diikat terus.** Membundarkan sudut putaran menukarkan litar ISA parametrik\n"
"kepada litar Clifford konkrit, jadi `clifford.num_parameters` menjadi `0`. PUB yang masih\n"
"membawa array nilai-parameter gagal dipaksa. Untuk larian tempatan, buang array parameter\n"
"daripada PUB; larian perkakasan mengekalkan litar parametrik asal dan nilainya.\n"

